{"id":4811,"date":"2025-07-25T13:25:40","date_gmt":"2025-07-25T13:25:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4811"},"modified":"2025-08-11T07:03:49","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T07:03:49","slug":"cach-xoa-logo-tiktok-don-gian-full-hd","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/cach-xoa-logo-tiktok-don-gian-full-hd\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch xo\u00e1 logo TikTok \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n, full HD, mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"OnW8du5vGolbXVxo5wdlDXgRgcI\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VnlYdur2LozJjJxvIu9l6RYEgTh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Xo\u00e1 logo TikTok \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n, mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed b\u1eb1ng SnapTik, SaveTik ho\u1eb7c CapCut. Gi\u1eef ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng full HD, d\u1ec5 d\u00f9ng, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n. C\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\">Lemon Digital<\/span><\/strong><\/a> kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 th\u00eam nhi\u1ec1u c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 v\u00e0 m\u1eb9o x\u1eed l\u00fd video TikTok th\u00f4ng minh, ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u nh\u1ea5t cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BI7cd1QE4o9glixZQYjlLqAngVf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ZvJnd9e0oocJ0vxD1YYlJFZPgec\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong> 1. 4 C\u00e1ch xo\u00e1 ch\u1eef tiktok tr\u00ean video \u0111\u00e3 t\u1ea3i v\u1ec1 <\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NkbOdTYZbomWlfx7QRcl3nsDgod\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi t\u1ea3i video t\u1eeb TikTok v\u1ec1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i ho\u1eb7c m\u00e1y t\u00ednh, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd th\u1ea5y logo TikTok v\u00e0 t\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb tr\u00ean khung h\u00ecnh. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 g\u00e2y b\u1ea5t ti\u1ec7n n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n chia s\u1ebb l\u1ea1i video tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kh\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c l\u01b0u gi\u1eef b\u1ea3n g\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda. May m\u1eafn thay, hi\u1ec7n c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n x\u00f3a ch\u1eef TikTok (watermark) m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n, t\u1eeb vi\u1ec7c d\u00f9ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 online \u0111\u1ebfn ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda b\u1eb1ng \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng. Trong ph\u1ea7n d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y, ch\u00fang ta s\u1ebd c\u00f9ng t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u 4 c\u00e1ch ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf logo TikTok kh\u1ecfi video \u0111\u00e3 t\u1ea3i v\u1ec1, t\u1eeb c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ebfn n\u00e2ng cao.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4813\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4813\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4813\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-1.png\" alt=\"4 C\u00e1ch xo\u00e1 ch\u1eef tiktok tr\u00ean video \u0111\u00e3 t\u1ea3i v\u1ec1\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4813\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">4 C\u00e1ch xo\u00e1 ch\u1eef tiktok tr\u00ean video \u0111\u00e3 t\u1ea3i v\u1ec1<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-FRs3dS0qtoVXTtxA2SqlxOvNgV5\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1.1. T\u1ea3i video TikTok kh\u00f4ng logo b\u1eb1ng website h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O1cmdwF8To8JwCxQIeQlz3FEgQe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n v\u00e0 ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf logo tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi t\u1ea3i video v\u1ec1.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EIrVdvA3NoVdPyxRlFSlPVcCgnu\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YIF4dVLecouzAjxru4rl8a7Agnc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: M\u1edf TikTok, ch\u1ecdn video \u2192 nh\u1ea5n Chia s\u1ebb &gt; Sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EPsodcB3lo7h5fxwxSclkbxqg0q\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div>\n<div>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Truy c\u1eadp c\u00e1c website:<\/div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L0MwdzMxXoLrdAxqN5klO7ZMgOf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><a href=\"https:\/\/ssstik.io\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ssstik.io<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DCAVdQAk3oABVuxWzj5l3oKggv3\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><a href=\"https:\/\/snaptik.app\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">snaptik.app<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RfnqdQqQ9o0cn7xbNXXlkXtYg8b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><a href=\"https:\/\/tikdown.org\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tikdown.org<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vf3AdYsYXogHjIxjXMXlFOWrgjc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: D\u00e1n link, ch\u1ecdn Download without watermark (T\u1ea3i kh\u00f4ng logo)<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-URVqdDh8loDkyKxSdePlM46Ggbb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: Video t\u1ea3i v\u1ec1 s\u1ebd s\u1ea1ch logo, s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MnNJdNAvFoT852x34EJl5zlLg1d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-QvgidqVtvoJvwNxuHholIfmJgac\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1.2. C\u1eaft logo b\u1eb1ng \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda video<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LbO1dpG20ovtKQxRGxgl75oigQe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 t\u1ea3i video TikTok v\u1ec1 nh\u01b0ng d\u00ednh logo, gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 l\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1eaft ph\u1ea7n ch\u1ee9a logo. Th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng, logo TikTok n\u1eb1m \u1edf g\u00f3c tr\u00ean b\u00ean tr\u00e1i v\u00e0 ID ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng \u1edf g\u00f3c d\u01b0\u1edbi b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 m\u1edf video trong c\u00e1c app nh\u01b0 CapCut, InShot ho\u1eb7c VN Video Editor, sau \u0111\u00f3 d\u00f9ng t\u00ednh n\u0103ng crop (c\u1eaft khung) \u0111\u1ec3 lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf c\u00e1c ph\u1ea7n \u0111\u00f3. Tuy nhi\u00ean, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n l\u01b0u \u00fd l\u00e0 vi\u1ec7c c\u1eaft video c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m thay \u0111\u1ed5i t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 khung h\u00ecnh ban \u0111\u1ea7u, \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ebfn b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c n\u1ed9i dung. M\u1ed9t m\u1eb9o l\u00e0 n\u00ean ch\u1ecdn ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 n\u1ec1n \u0111en ho\u1eb7c l\u00e0m m\u1edd khung vi\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef t\u00ednh th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9. C\u00e1ch n\u00e0y r\u1ea5t ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111ang ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda nhi\u1ec1u video v\u00e0 mu\u1ed1n nhanh ch\u00f3ng l\u00e0m s\u1ea1ch logo m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n t\u1ea3i l\u1ea1i t\u1eeb c\u00e1c trang web kh\u00e1c. \u0110\u00e2y c\u0169ng l\u00e0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng \u00e1n ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung TikTok khi re-edit l\u1ea1i video g\u1ed1c.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LbO1dpG20ovtKQxRGxgl75oigQe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4814\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4814\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4814\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/4-1.png\" alt=\"C\u00f3 \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c sinh ra \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 nhu c\u1ea7u s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o v\u00e0 ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda n\u1ed9i dung s\u1ed1, t\u1eeb video, \u1ea3nh, \u00e2m thanh cho \u0111\u1ebfn t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/4-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/4-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/4-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/4-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/4-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4814\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00f3 \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c sinh ra \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 nhu c\u1ea7u s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o v\u00e0 ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda n\u1ed9i dung s\u1ed1, t\u1eeb video, \u1ea3nh, \u00e2m thanh cho \u0111\u1ebfn t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<h3>\u00a0<\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-WpYwd0i9iojptUx00BMlkUxrgZc\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1.3. L\u00e0m m\u1edd ho\u1eb7c che ph\u1ee7 logo TikTok<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KqD5d98R1oCfpIxLWerlbSCUgsT\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p kh\u00f4ng mu\u1ed1n c\u1eaft khung h\u00ecnh, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m m\u1edd ho\u1eb7c che ph\u1ee7 logo TikTok b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1c hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng ho\u1eb7c sticker trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda video. C\u00e1c ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m nh\u01b0 CapCut, Canva Video, ho\u1eb7c VivaVideo \u0111\u1ec1u cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n ch\u00e8n l\u1edbp ph\u1ee7 v\u00e0o video. C\u00e1ch n\u00e0y ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p n\u1ebfu logo n\u1eb1m g\u1ea7n trung t\u00e2m ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n gi\u1eef nguy\u00ean to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 khung h\u00ecnh g\u1ed1c. B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n k\u00e9o m\u1ed9t l\u1edbp blur (l\u00e0m m\u1edd) l\u00ean ph\u1ea7n ch\u1ee9a logo ho\u1eb7c d\u00e1n m\u1ed9t sticker, bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c ch\u1eef l\u00ean \u0111\u00f3. Ngo\u00e0i ra, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i n\u00e0y \u0111\u1ec3 g\u1eafn logo th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh, t\u0103ng t\u00ednh nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n n\u1ebfu \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i l\u1ea1i tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kh\u00e1c nh\u01b0 YouTube Shorts hay Instagram Reels. D\u00f9 kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m m\u1ea5t ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n logo, c\u00e1ch n\u00e0y gi\u00fap gi\u1ea3m \u0111\u1ed9 ch\u00fa \u00fd \u0111\u1ebfn watermark m\u00e0 v\u1eabn b\u1ea3o to\u00e0n n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 g\u1ed1c c\u1ee7a video.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-KTZKdwInAoJFfCxY1ZBlkXt2gCg\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1.4. D\u00f9ng ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m x\u00f3a logo b\u1eb1ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 AI<\/strong><\/h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4817\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4817\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4817\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-1.png\" alt=\"D\u00f9ng ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m x\u00f3a logo TikTok b\u1eb1ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 AI, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf watermark m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch nhanh ch\u00f3ng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4817\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">D\u00f9ng ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m x\u00f3a logo TikTok b\u1eb1ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 AI, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf watermark m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch nhanh ch\u00f3ng<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VWT8dnb62oH0ADx8kgXlotJWgIh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u1edbi s\u1ef1 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7, ng\u00e0y nay \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m v\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 x\u00f3a logo video b\u1eb1ng AI v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. C\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 nh\u01b0 HitPaw Watermark Remover, Apowersoft Watermark Remover, Media.io ho\u1eb7c ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m video enhancer tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ec1u c\u00f3 t\u00ednh n\u0103ng t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n v\u00e0 lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf watermark kh\u1ecfi video. B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n nh\u1eadp video v\u00e0o ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m, ch\u1ecdn v\u00f9ng c\u00f3 ch\u1ee9a logo, AI s\u1ebd x\u1eed l\u00fd v\u00e0 t\u00e1i t\u1ea1o l\u1ea1i v\u00f9ng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u0111\u00e3 b\u1ecb che. \u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m c\u1ee7a ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p n\u00e0y l\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m m\u1ea5t khung h\u00ecnh, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n c\u1eaft n\u1ed9i dung. Tuy nhi\u00ean, k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c nhi\u1ec1u v\u00e0o \u0111\u1ed9 ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p c\u1ee7a h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh n\u1ec1n v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng AI c\u1ee7a t\u1eebng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed s\u1ebd gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n t\u00ednh n\u0103ng, c\u00f2n b\u1ea3n cao c\u1ea5p th\u01b0\u1eddng y\u00eau c\u1ea7u tr\u1ea3 ph\u00ed. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, c\u1ea7n video \u201cs\u1ea1ch\u201d \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00e1i s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ho\u1eb7c d\u1ef1ng clip m\u1edbi ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PucQd6qHnopyr6xBZwTleFgcgbb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-GpWpd85tyoTek1xELFPlizthg5g\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng uy t\u00edn gi\u00fap x\u00f3a logo Tiktok<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GSTtdeUO8oa9fGx2ahJlQNI4gFf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ed7i \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ec1u c\u00f3 \u01b0u \u0111i\u1ec3m ri\u00eang, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhu c\u1ea7u kh\u00e1c nhau c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng, t\u1eeb thao t\u00e1c nhanh g\u1ecdn \u0111\u1ebfn ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda chuy\u00ean s\u00e2u:<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-CAR6dynawosy8FxQXTMlxdMtgOd\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2.1. SnapTik<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Li3Pd4LsroEakOxWcxZlx0Q1gXf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">SnapTik l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u00e0 ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn cho ph\u00e9p t\u1ea3i video TikTok kh\u00f4ng d\u00ednh logo watermark. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft video TikTok, d\u00e1n v\u00e0o thanh t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm c\u1ee7a SnapTik v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn \u201cT\u1ea3i xu\u1ed1ng\u201d. \u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng n\u00e0y h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u1ea3 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng Android, iOS v\u00e0 phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n website n\u00ean c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i, nhanh ch\u00f3ng v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 thao t\u00e1c, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n t\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n hay \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n gi\u1eef nguy\u00ean ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng video g\u1ed1c.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4812\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4812\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4812\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-2.png\" alt=\"SnapTik \u2013 m\u1ed9t c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n t\u1ea3i video TikTok kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 watermark (logo)\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4812\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">SnapTik \u2013 m\u1ed9t c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n t\u1ea3i video TikTok kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 watermark (logo)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"OnW8du5vGolbXVxo5wdlDXgRgcI\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Xja0d3sU3oXPKkx9VZulmdqlgLd\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2.2. Video Eraser<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HpbQdTQuNohKB1xYy9hlJfXWgEc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Video Eraser l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng iOS v\u00e0 Android, gi\u00fap x\u00f3a watermark ho\u1eb7c logo b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch l\u00e0m m\u1edd, c\u1eaft ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e8n v\u1eadt th\u1ec3 \u0111\u00e8 l\u00ean v\u1ecb tr\u00ed ch\u1ee9a ch\u1eef \u201cTikTok\u201d. Ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m n\u00e0y ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho nh\u1eefng ai \u0111\u00e3 l\u1ee1 t\u1ea3i video c\u00f3 logo m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng d\u00f9ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 t\u1ea3i kh\u00f4ng watermark t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ea7u. Ngo\u00e0i t\u00ednh n\u0103ng ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 x\u00f3a logo, Video Eraser c\u00f2n cho ph\u00e9p ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n nh\u01b0 c\u1eaft video, thay \u0111\u1ed5i t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 khung h\u00ecnh. B\u1ea3n mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i watermark c\u1ee7a ch\u00ednh \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, b\u1ea3n tr\u1ea3 ph\u00ed s\u1ebd lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4815\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4815\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4815\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5-1.png\" alt=\"ideo Eraser l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 b\u1ea1n xo\u00e1 logo, watermark ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00f4ng mong mu\u1ed1n\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4815\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Video Eraser l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 b\u1ea1n xo\u00e1 logo, watermark ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00f4ng mong mu\u1ed1n<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"OnW8du5vGolbXVxo5wdlDXgRgcI\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-WS4cdzypEohrKvxTHTlldTtMgVh\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2.3. SaveTik<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P5MPdAQ0KoszV4xuY6ilbFf1gBe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">SaveTik l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 online ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1 SnapTik. B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n d\u00e1n \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng link video TikTok v\u00e0 SaveTik s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng ph\u00e2n t\u00edch, cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n t\u1ea3i xu\u1ed1ng video ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 watermark. \u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt l\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n t\u1ea3i app, kh\u00f4ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o l\u00e0m phi\u1ec1n, v\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean m\u1ecdi thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb t\u1eeb m\u00e1y t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i. Giao di\u1ec7n th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n, t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 x\u1eed l\u00fd video nhanh, gi\u00fap ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m th\u1eddi gian \u0111\u00e1ng k\u1ec3 cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4818\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4818\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4818\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/6-1.png\" alt=\"SaveTik \u2014 m\u1ed9t c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 t\u1ea3i video TikTok kh\u00f4ng d\u00ednh logo (watermark)\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/6-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/6-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/6-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/6-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/6-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4818\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">SaveTik \u2014 m\u1ed9t c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 t\u1ea3i video TikTok kh\u00f4ng d\u00ednh logo (watermark)<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"OnW8du5vGolbXVxo5wdlDXgRgcI\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-MIYGdg5ZdoSfxuxNBnel65X1g4b\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2.4. Capcut<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LfC6d3Q65oyxIFxgrB2l77nZgCe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">CapCut kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 x\u00f3a logo, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda video chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n b\u1edfi ch\u00ednh c\u00f4ng ty m\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a TikTok (ByteDance). Khi \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 video ch\u1ee9a watermark, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng CapCut \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1eaft b\u1ecf ph\u1ea7n khung h\u00ecnh c\u00f3 logo, ho\u1eb7c th\u00eam hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh, ch\u1eef vi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec3 che logo m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o. Ngo\u00e0i ra, CapCut h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 th\u00eam nh\u1ea1c, filter, hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng chuy\u1ec3n c\u1ea3nh, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho c\u1ea3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi v\u00e0 d\u00e2n s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4804\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4804\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4804\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5.png\" alt=\"CapCut l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda video v\u00e0 \u1ea3nh c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng TikTok.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4804\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">CapCut l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda video v\u00e0 \u1ea3nh c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng TikTok.<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-IhJDdlPEKoCcj8xMJ9tlJlEWgge\"><strong>2.5. 123 Apps<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P2yzd0EqzoHKwnxwTcrluTr4gCf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">123Apps l\u00e0 b\u1ed9 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda video tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng web, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n t\u1ea3i ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ecnh c\u1eaft video \u0111\u1ec3 lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf khung ch\u1ee9a logo, ho\u1eb7c th\u00eam sticker, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ec3 che watermark TikTok m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch linh ho\u1ea1t. 123Apps c\u0169ng h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nhi\u1ec1u t\u00ednh n\u0103ng h\u1eefu \u00edch kh\u00e1c nh\u01b0 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng video, ch\u1ec9nh \u00e2m thanh, gh\u00e9p nh\u1ea1c\u2026 r\u1ea5t ti\u1ec7n cho c\u00e1c thao t\u00e1c x\u1eed l\u00fd h\u1eadu k\u1ef3 m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m c\u1ed3ng k\u1ec1nh.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AE7kdVj40omQ9Lx4VTole1JLgfg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4816\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4816\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4816\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/7-1.png\" alt=\"123Apps kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 chuy\u00ean bi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00f3a watermark TikTok nh\u01b0ng b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 Crop video \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1eaft ph\u1ea7n logo\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/7-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/7-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/7-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/7-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/7-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4816\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">123Apps kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 chuy\u00ean bi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00f3a watermark TikTok nh\u01b0ng b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 Crop video \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1eaft ph\u1ea7n logo<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"OnW8du5vGolbXVxo5wdlDXgRgcI\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-LjhOdm2uWo1o2zx0uwmlY1AHgZc\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>3. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 l\u01b0u \u00fd quan tr\u1ecdng<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AKgedRZmQoMeXpxMTxTleYn0g4f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n x\u00f3a logo TikTok kh\u1ecfi video \u0111\u00e3 t\u1ea3i v\u1ec1, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n l\u01b0u \u00fd m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec3m quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 t\u00ednh h\u1ee3p ph\u00e1p c\u1ee7a n\u1ed9i dung. Tr\u01b0\u1edbc h\u1ebft, vi\u1ec7c c\u1eaft khung h\u00ecnh ho\u1eb7c l\u00e0m m\u1edd logo c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 khi\u1ebfn video b\u1ecb gi\u1ea3m ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, do \u0111\u00f3 n\u00ean \u01b0u ti\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 t\u1ea3i video kh\u00f4ng logo nh\u01b0 SnapTik, SaveTik \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef nguy\u00ean \u0111\u1ed9 s\u1eafc n\u00e9t. Ngo\u00e0i ra, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n ki\u1ec3m tra b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n n\u1ed9i dung tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t n\u1ebfu c\u00f3 \u00fd \u0111\u1ecbnh chia s\u1ebb l\u1ea1i tr\u00ean c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kh\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c d\u00f9ng cho m\u1ee5c \u0111\u00edch th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i. H\u00e3y ch\u1ecdn nh\u1eefng \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng uy t\u00edn \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh r\u1ee7i ro v\u1ec1 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ed9c h\u1ea1i ho\u1eb7c l\u1ed9 d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n. M\u1ed9t l\u01b0u \u00fd quan tr\u1ecdng n\u1eefa l\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng n\u00ean x\u00f3a logo TikTok \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u00e1nh l\u1eeba ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem hay \u0111\u1ea1o nh\u00e1i n\u1ed9i dung ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00e1c. Cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng, lu\u00f4n l\u01b0u l\u1ea1i b\u1ea3n g\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 kh\u00f4i ph\u1ee5c n\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n. C\u00f9ng Lemon Digital s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 t\u00f4n tr\u1ecdng c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng m\u1ea1ng!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ja5RdAUQqoPpUcxAtarloenng7d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XMOpdhhEMomBO6x2kPtl3VhggYe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AGOXdgSMToCIPexdHdGlrpLEgGc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=